        "<lora:minimax_h3_fl2v_lightx2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfy_fro_v4:0.5>\nHand-drawn color pencil look: simulated VHS tracking artifacts, chrome palm trees, glitter, retro atmosphere, mood languid and nostalgic.\n\nTimeline:\n[0s-1s] VHS static opens the frame, the title [\"COMFYUI\":\"PROMPT CONTROL\":0.2] appears with RGB split and a slight horizontal jitter.\n[1s-2.5s] Hard cut, a sketch of a greek-style statue of the [blonde:color-inverted:0.2] fennec girl in <Picture 1>, following its coloration and prominent features.\n[2.5s-4s] Clean \"STARRING\" credits appear, \"LATENT\" and [\"CONTROLNET\":\"SCHEDULING\":0.2] each shown exactly once.\n[4s-5s] Final card [\"DIRECTED BY COMFYUI\":\"DIRECTED BY PROMPT CONTROL\":0.2] holds, one VHS tracking glitch settling into stability.\n\nTransitions happen with a hasty draw-over effect.\n\nAudio: [A simple jazzy piano piece:Classic piano metal fusion:0.2].\n\nAll text must be clearly legible, do not misspell English, no Chinese characters, do not repeat names or job titles, no soft dissolves, no subtitle bars."
